---
description: Ship vscode-extension changes onto the installed Cursor extension in the same turn
globs: vscode-extension/**/*
alwaysApply: true
---

# Ship the extension immediately

Changes here are not done until the running extension has them.

- Commit and push to `origin` on the shipping branch. Do not open a PR and wait.
- Package `vscode-extension` (`npx @vscode/vsce package --no-dependencies`) and install that VSIX with `cursor --install-extension <vsix> --force`.
- A local edit does not update `~/.cursor/extensions/latentprotocol.latent-protocol-vscode-*`.
